  "notes": "12ch chart transcribed from U'King's own PDF manual (Big Steel Gun Manual, ZQ02341-Beam-Moving-Head-Light.pdf). The manual lists '8 colours, half colour effect', '8 patterns', '6+12 prism' and 18-facet prism on the product page; colour and gobo names are not given anywhere found. Dimensions 38.5 x 26.5 x 26.0 cm and 5 kg come from the U'King product page and are probably the packaged size (dimensions_guess); Amazon's manuals.plus page (blocked, HTTP 403) may list the bare-fixture size. Beam angle 2.8 deg per U'King (search snippet also cites '2 deg'). CONFLICTS with the repo's 12ch Betopper map that this fixture is assumed to share: here ch6 = Dimmer and ch7 = Strobe (repo order is the same, fine), but ch11 is an auto/sound macro channel, not Focus, and the colour wheel has 8 slots in 10-value steps (0-9 white, 10-79 colours 1-7) rather than 9 colours; 80-139 are half-colours. The repo GDTF UKing@ZQ02341_150W_Big_Steel_Gun_LED_Moving_Head_Beam (2024-R001) should be the definitive reference for slot names/colours -- not opened here. The Betopper LB150 (betopper-150w-beam.json) uses a different, finer colour/gobo layout even though it is the same chassis family."
